cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Analysis pipeline for "Protein abundance modulates the structural localization
  of continuous-time quantum walks on mitochondrial pathway networks"
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Amine
    family-names: Bougarne
    email: amine.bougarne@um5r.ac.ma
    affiliation: Faculty of Medicine and Pharmacy, Mohammed V University, Rabat, Morocco
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6896-6926
abstract: >-
  Jupyter notebooks and derived result tables implementing a continuous-time
  quantum walk analysis of the MitoCarta 3.0 mitochondrial pathway network,
  weighted by tissue-resolved mass-spectrometric protein abundance, together
  with permutation-based inference, robustness analyses and a benchmark against
  eight non-quantum comparators.
keywords:
  - continuous-time quantum walk
  - mitochondrial pathway network
  - MitoCarta
  - quantum-inspired network analysis
  - permutation null model
  - proteomics
